UPVC pipe is a plastic pipe made of polyvinyl chloride (PVC) resin without plasticizer. With the development of chemical industry technology, it is now possible to produce non-toxic grade pipes, so it has the properties of general polyvinyl chloride and has added some excellent properties.
It does not occupy indoor area. The radiator and other branch pipes are eliminated indoors, which increases the usable area and is convenient for decoration and furniture arrangement.
PVCU pipes are hygienic and non-toxic, they do not scale, breed algae and other microorganisms in the process of using, and will not cause secondary pollution to water.
PVC-U pipe with smooth inner wall and small resistance to flow, with a rate of .08-0.00 water transmission capacity than cast iron pipe increased by 25%, 509%62 increase in concrete pipes Long life
◎ Impact resistance: pipe wall U-shaped structure, impact resistance, pressure resistance, the foundation does not break under sinking conditions, and after deformation of the pipe wall U-shaped structure. Highly resilient and adaptable to all foundations.
◎ Cold resistance: pipe in -60 ℃ environment will not be frozen crack and expansion of water leakage.
◎ Connection is convenient: the pipe can be connected outside the trench first and then pushed into the trench by excavator to reduce the project time and cost.
◎ Environmental impact: HDPE is a non-toxic raw materials, harmless to the land and other environments, and can be recycled.
◎ Completely reliable ring stiffness: due to the elastic modulus ratio of steel and plastic materials is more than 200, weight ratio is more than 7.85. It is therefore very easy to achieve sufficient safe and reliable ring stiffness and relative stiffness for the pipe, especially for large diameters, compared to pure plastic pipes.
◎ Industrial: sewage pipes for a wide range of industrial applications.
◎ Water storage systems: water storage systems that capture slow-moving water.
In coastal areas, the groundwater level is high and the land is humid. The use of metal or other pipes must be anticorrosive, and the service life is generally only 30 years.
PE pipe is a high toughness pipe with an elongation at break of more than 500%. The ability to adapt to uneven ground settlement and dislocation is very strong.
◎ Good electrical insulation performance, long service life (more than 50 years for underground pipes), durable, and safe and reliable line operation
In addition to the traditional excavation methods for PE pipes, a variety of new non-excavation technologies can also be used, such as pipe jacking, lining pipes, cracked pipes, etc. This is the only place where excavation is not allowed select.
When PE pipe is processed, no heavy metal salt stabilizer is added, the material is non-toxic, no scaling layer, no bacteria breeding, and it solves the secondary pollution of urban drinking water.
Except for a few strong oxidants, it can withstand the erosion of a variety of chemical media; there is no electrochemical corrosion.
