What happened to Slackware and Deepin? I think the list should be updated and a little more in-depth analysis of the linux distros should be done.
I went through ubuntu, linux mint, manjaro, solus, and some other distro, but with none I felt as comfortable and satisfied as with MX Linux. I have been using it for a couple of years and I find it robust, lightweight and very easy to use.
