1.1 Visual enhancements
Within of the main changes that can be highlighted in what will be this new branch from the KDE desktop environment, Find the new battery charge monitoring widget.
Visual enhancements Furthermore, the dialog for customizing desktop wallpaper has built-in functions for downloading and installing new plugins with the implementation of dynamic wallpaper.
For blind users, support for collecting icons through screen readers has been added.
Added the ability to enable cyclical scrolling when reaching the end of the virtual desktop list.
The usability in the program search interface (KRunner) has also been improved, since the correct handling of duplicates was implemented in the output.
On the "Stationery" page in the configurator, third-party stationery, installed via the store.kde.org catalog, is now displayed.
