Q: Do I have to compete to be a Fred Astaire Dance Studios Student?
Competing is absolutely not required in order to dance with us. Our Dance Competitions (regional, inter-regional and national) are optional tools to help you improve your dancing, gain confidence, meet new friends, travel, and have FUN!
